### 2. ELEVENLABS AGENT PROCEDURES & TOOL DEFINITIONS

Configure the ElevenLabs Agent with the following automated procedures:

1. Patient Identity Verification (`verify_patient`):
   - Parameters: `patient_name`, `dob_or_phone`, `mrn_number`.
   - Returns verified patient ID and active bookings.
2. Schedule / Reschedule Appointment (`book_appointment`):
   - Parameters: `patient_id`, `doctor_id` / `specialty`, `preferred_datetime`, `appointment_type` (in-person, video, routine).
   - Tool Webhook: POST `https://<n8n-url>/webhook/agent/book_appointment`
   - Returns appointment reference (e.g., `APT-2026-881290`).
3. Symptom Triage & Intake Reporting (`submit_triage`):
   - Parameters: `patient_id`, `symptom_summary`, `severity` (mild, moderate, urgent), `duration_days`, `has_file_attachment` (boolean), `conversation_id`.
   - Tool Webhook: POST `https://<n8n-url>/webhook/agent/submit_triage`
   - Returns triage reference (e.g., `TRG-5A91F20C`).
4. Prescription Refill Request (`request_refill`):
   - Parameters: `patient_id`, `medication_name`, `dosage`, `pharmacy_name`.
   - Tool Webhook: POST `https://<n8n-url>/webhook/agent/refill_medication`
   - Returns refill request ID (e.g., `RX-901234`).
5. Human Clinical Triage Escalation (`escalate_to_nurse`):
   - Parameters: `urgency_reason`, `patient_contact`.
   - Webhook creates an immediate priority nurse handoff ticket.

